  "articleBody": "Before requesting room addition proposals, define how the space will be used, gather property records, identify utility and access constraints, and prepare questions about design, permits, construction, inspections, and changes. A complete project brief helps contractors compare the same scope and gives you a more meaningful estimate for your San Diego County home.",
